AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fypo#usage> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fypo#has_output> "Def comes from gorel file. Used in FYPO where one phenotype (p) always results in an additional phenotype (c) as a consequence. There may be other ways to get phenotype (c).")
