# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000015> (branched vegetative cell)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000015> "A cell morphology phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which a daughter cell begins to grow from the lateral portion of the long axis of the cell, and at an angle to the septum or cell division site of the mother cell, resulting in the formation of a single cell that has a branch.")
