# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000020> (pear-shaped cell)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000020> "A cell morphology phenotype in which a cell is shaped in the form of a pear. One end is rounded, while the other resembles an end of a normal rod-shaped cell. The normally shaped end has the same diameter as a wild-type cell.")
