AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000169> "Chromatin silencing phenotypes may reflect the assembly or maintenance of heterochromatin. See the GO cellular component term 'heterochromatin' (GO:0000792), and the biological process term 'heterochromatin organization' (GO:0070828).")
