# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000173> (abnormal mitotic cell cycle DNA replication checkpoint)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000173> "A cell cycle checkpoint phenotype in which the DNA replication checkpoint in a mitotic cell cycle is abnormal. The DNA replication checkpoint normally prevents the initiation of mitosis until DNA replication is complete. In a mutant, the checkpoint may fail to arrest or delay cell cycle progression under appropriate conditions, or the incidence or duration of arrest or delay may differ from wild type under any specified set of conditions.")
