AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000228> "Chromosome lagging may reflect a delay in detachment of sister chromatids from each other ('chromatid separation' as defined by GO:0051306), polewards movement (GO:0007079), or both. Consider also annotating to 'unequal mitotic sister chromatid segregation' (FYPO:0003241) or one of its descendants, because chromosomes that lag at anaphase are often missegregated at telophase.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000228> "lagging mitotic chromosomes")
