AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000238> "Note that if you have done an experiment that assays the viability of a population of cells, such as looking at colony growth or growth in liquid culture, you should also annotate to 'inviable cell population' (FYPO:0002059) or one of its descendants. The population term 'loss of viability upon G0 to G1 transition' (FYPO:0006660) may also be relevant.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000238> "inviable cell upon G0 to G1 transition")
