AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000244> "Use this term to annotate experiments in which a culture is grown under nutrient-depleted conditions, and then the number of cells viable enough to form a colony upon return to nutrient-replete conditions is measured and compared to wild type. Also consider 'sensitive to nitrogen starvation' (FYPO:0002124).")
