# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000785> (sensitive to formamide)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000785> "A phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which cells show increased sensitivity to formamide. Cells stop growing (and may die) at a concentration of formamide that allows wild type cells to grow.")
