AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000850> "A phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which cells show decreased sensitivity to a stress. Typically, a cell population is deemed resistant to a stress if cells in the population grow and divide when exposed to the stress at an intensity at which wild-type cells stop growing (and may die).")
