AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001046> "Use this term for any experiments that detect early mitosis by any criteria. If you have measured CDK activity or calculated the transition point, also consider using 'premature mitotic G2/M transition' (FYPO:0002516). Also consider annotating to 'viable small vegetative cell' (FYPO:0000648), if mitosis takes place when cells are smaller than normal.")
