AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001119> "Note that the difference between 'tapered cell' (FYPO:0000014) and 'spindle-shaped cell' (FYPO:0007230) is that a tapered cell is narrow at only one end, whereas a spindle-shaped cell is narrow at both ends.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001119> "tapered vegetative cell")
