# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001165> (inviable cell following anaerobic growth)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001165> "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which a cell that is exposed to anaerobic conditions fails to grow upon being returned to aerobic conditions, and eventually dies.")
