AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001165> "Note that if you have done an experiment that assays the viability of a population of cells, such as looking at colony growth or growth in liquid culture, you should also annotate to 'inviable cell population' (FYPO:0002059) or one of its descendants.")
