AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001203> "Note: coflocculation between S. pombe and E. coli is sensitive to mannose but not to glucose or galactose. Plant lectins such as HHA, GNA, NPA, or Concanavalin A (ConA) decrease but do not abolish S. pombe-E. coli coflocculation. Cations have different effects: Li+, Na+, K+, Mg2+ or Mn2+ increase coflocculation, Co2+, Zn2+, and Ca2+ have no effect, and Cu2+ or Hg2+ completely abolish coflocculation.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001203> "coflocculating cells")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001203> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0000155>)

