AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001231> "This is a high-level term whose primary purpose is to organize terms beneath it in the ontology, and we expect that it will not be used for direct annotations. Please consider using a more specific term to annotate each phenotype: Note that an abnormal cell cortex organization process may, but does not necessarily, result in abnormal cell cortex morphology.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001231> "normal cell cortex morphology")
