AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001430> "Arrest with unreplicated DNA may occur between mitosis and the beginning of S phase; if only DNA content is measured, the arrest point cannot be determined with greater precision.")
