AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:21811607") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001469> "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the steady-state intracellular calcium ion (Ca2+) concentration increases to a greater extent than normal following an extracellular Ca2+ stimulus. Normally, a dose-dependent increased steady-state Ca2+ concentration is reached within 2-3 minutes of extracellular Ca2+ addition, and is sustained for several hours.")
