AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:18923422") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:al") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001742> "A cell phenotype in which isochromosome formation occurs more frequently than in wild type cells. In isochromosome formation, one chromosome arm is lost and the other arm is duplicated in its place.")
