AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001873> "The difference between this term and FYPO:0006010 is that the former describes shmoo formation when no compatible cells are present, whereas the latter describes failure to make contact with available cells of the opposite mating type.")
