AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001973> "FYPO:0001973")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001973> "This term was made obsolete because no cells are known to match the criteria of its definition (cut plus abnormal septum disassembly after cytokinesis). Its name was also not updated to reflect the name of the referenced GO term.")
