AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0001989> "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which cells show increased sensitivity to pH lower than that of standard S. pombe growth media (about 5.8). Cells stop growing (and may die) at a pH that allows wild type cells to grow.")
