AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:2211869") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Leaf_morphology.svg&oldid=313835870") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002005> "A physical cellular phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the nuclear envelope has a lobate cross-section, i.e. one in which the edge has deep indentations or undulations that form lobes.")
