AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002047> "This term can be used for any circumstances in which cells are starved for nitrogen. Note that cells may enter G0 (quiescence) when subjected to prolonged nitrogen starvation; this term is not restricted to G0.")
