AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002091> "Chromosome lagging may reflect a delay in detachment of homologous chromosomes or sister chromatids from each other ('chromosome separation' as defined by GO:0051307), polewards movement (GO:0016344), or both.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002091> "lagging meiotic chromosomes")
