# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002181> (obsolete inviable mixed population including germinated spores and spheroid cells)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:vw") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002181> "OBSOLETE. A mixed population phenotype in which all cells in a population are inviable, and the population includes a mixture of germinated spores and spheroid vegetative cells. The spheroid cells arise from division of some of the germinated spores, and may form a microcolony of up to 64 cells.")
