AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002215> "Note that if you have done an experiment that assays the viability of a population of cells, such as looking at colony growth or growth in liquid culture, you should also annotate to 'viable cell population' (FYPO:0002058) or one of its descendants.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002215> "viable curved elongated vegetative cell")
