# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002251> (inviable swollen elongated vegetative cell)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002251> "A cell morphology phenotype in which a vegetative cell is inviable and has a larger volume, and is longer, than normal. In a swollen cell, both length and diameter may be greater than normal, although the cell is only considered elongated if the length:diameter ratio is also greater than normal.")
