AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002639> "Use this term in cases where \"stretching\" refers to the distance between sister kinetochores of duplicated chromosomes that are bioriented on the spindle during mitosis. Also see 'abnormal kinetochore localization' (FYPO:0001778) and 'abnormal mitotic sister chromatid segregation' (FYPO:0000141).")
