AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002653> "This term can be used for protein transport or for the movement of other substances (e.g. lipids or ions) into the vacuole. If it is used for a protein transport phenotype, we recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay.")
