AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002843> "protein mislocalised to nucleoplasm during vegetative growth")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002843> "protein mislocalized to nucleoplasm during vegetative growth")
