AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:vw") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002987> "A phenotype in which a spore germinates to produce an inviable cell that does not divide, contains two nuclei, has a larger diameter and volume than normal, and has an abnormal shape featuring a constriction at the center of the cell, corresponding to the cell division site. In some such cells, the diameter at the ends is much greater than in wild-type cells.")
