# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0003211> (abnormal secondary cell septum biogenesis)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0003211> "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which secondary cell septum biogenesis is abnormal. Secondary cell septum biogenesis results in the biosynthesis of constituent macromolecules, assembly, and arrangement of constituent parts of the secondary cell septum during cytokinesis.")
