# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0003438> (mitotic G1/S phase transition delay following nitrogen starvation-induced G1 phase arrest)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:8657126") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0003438> "A cell cycle phenotype in which the G1/S transition of the mitotic cell cycle begins later than normal after the cell has been arrested in G1 phase due to nitrogen starvation. The duration of G1 arrest is thus longer than normal.")
