AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0003548> "A G1/S delay may indicate that a checkpoint, such as the cell size checkpoint or the G1/S DNA damage checkpoint, is activated. Checkpoint activation can be tested using checkpoint kinase mutants.")
