AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:7957061") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0004098> "A cellular process phenotype in which mitotic sister chromatid segregation stops before completing separation of chromosomes, and most of the DNA remains in a single mass at or near the midpoint of the mitotic spindle, but portions of the chromosomes can separate along the spindle, resulting in the formation of a DNA mass shaped like the Greek letter phi.")
