AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "http://mathworld.wolfram.com/Lemon.html") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0004256> "A cell morphology phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which a single cell is viable, and grows in the form of a lemon. A lemon shape is defined mathematically as having a quadric surface in three dimensions obtained by rotating less than half of a circular arc about an axis passing through the endpoints of the arc.")
