AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0004331> "Note that the centromere central core corresponds to SO:0001796. Chromatin silencing phenotypes at the centromere central core may reflect the assembly or maintenance of CENP-A-containing chromatin. See the GO cellular component term 'CENP-A containing chromatin' (GO:0061638), and the biological process term 'CENP-A containing chromatin organization' (GO:0061641).")
