AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0004613> "This phenotype may result from either absence of the microtubule bundle that would normally attach to the SPB, or from a problem with the SPB-microtubule attachment process.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0004613> "abolished microtubule attachment to spindle pole body")
