AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0004698> "This term can mean that the mutated gene product itself binds heme less than wild type, or that a mutation in one gene decreases heme binding by a second gene product. When using this term, it is therefore recommended to note the specific protein(s) affected.")
