AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0004955> "This term can mean that the mutated gene product itself binds phosphatidylinositol-3-phosphate less than wild type, or that a mutation in one gene decreases phosphatidylinositol-3-phosphate binding by a second gene product. When using this term, it is therefore recommended to note the specific protein(s) affected.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0004955> "decreased phosphatidylinositol-3-phosphate binding")
