# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005633> (sister kinetochore dissociation in meiotic metaphase I, normal chromosome segregation in meiosis I, and sister chromatid non-disjunction in meiosis II)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:21920317") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:vw") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005633> "A physical cellular phenotype in which sister kinetochores separate during the first meiotic nuclear division, homologous chromosomes undergo normal reductional division, but sister chromatids divide unequally in meiosis II. Normally sister kinetochores remain together until meiosis II.  Normally sister kinetochores remain together until meiosis II.")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:created_by <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005633> "midori")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:creation_date <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005633> "2016-08-24T14:57:44Z")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005633> "abnormal chromosome segregation during first meiotic nuclear division with premature sister kinetochore separation, reductional chromosome separation, and unequal sister chromatid division")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005633> "abnormal chromosome segregation during meiosis I with premature sister kinetochore separation, reductional chromosome separation, and unequal sister chromatid division")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:vw") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005633> "precocious centromeric dissociation during meiosis I and normal chromosome division in meiosis I, and unequal sister chromatid segregation in meiosis II")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:vw") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005633> "premature sister kinetochore separation and normal chromosome disjunction in meiosis I, and unequal sister chromatid disjunction in meiosis II")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005633> "fission_yeast_phenotype")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005633> "FYPO:0005633")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005633> "This term describes the premature separation of paired, intact sister kinetochores. It has a related synonym using \"split kinetochores\" because that phrase is often used in the literature to describe this phenotype. It should not be confused with the FYPO terms that have \"split kinetochore\" in the names, because those names refer to cases where a single kinetochore has broken into parts.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005633> "sister kinetochore dissociation in meiotic metaphase I, normal chromosome segregation in meiosis I, and sister chromatid non-disjunction in meiosis II")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005633> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0003182>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005633> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005648>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> (sister kinetochore dissociation in meiotic metaphase I with  equational sister chromatid  segregation in meiosis I)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:21920317") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:vw") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> "A cellular process phenotype in which sister kinetochores become separated during the first meiotic nuclear division, and sister chromatids subsequently separate to result in equational segregation. Equational sister chromatid separation is caused by  bi-orientated attachment of sister chromatids.")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:created_by <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> "midori")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:creation_date <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> "2016-08-24T14:58:54Z")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:vw") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> "abnormal chromosome segregation during meiosis I with premature sister kinetochore separation and equational sister chromatid separation")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> "equational sister chromatid separation during first meiotic nuclear division")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:vw") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> "equational sister chromatid separation in meiosis I")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> "fission_yeast_phenotype")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:vw") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> "abolished monopolar kinetochore attachment during meiosis I")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> "equational sister chromatid separation during meiosis I with split kinetochores")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> "increased bi-orientated attachment of sister chromatids in meiosis I")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> "FYPO:0005634")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> "Sister kinetochores may separate in meiosis I due to problems with either sister chromatid cohesion or kinetochore attachment to microtubules. Therefore consider also annotating to 'abnormal attachment of spindle microtubules to kinetochore involved in homologous chromosome segregation' (FYPO:0000209), 'decreased meiotic sister chromatid cohesion' (FYPO:0002093), or 'merotelic kinetochore attachment during meiosis I' (FYPO:0005638). This term describes the premature separation of paired, intact sister kinetochores. It has a related synonym using \"split kinetochores\" because that phrase is often used in the literature to describe this phenotype. It should not be confused with the FYPO terms that have \"split kinetochore\" in the names, because those names refer to cases where a single kinetochore has broken into parts.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> "sister kinetochore dissociation in meiotic metaphase I with  equational sister chromatid  segregation in meiosis I")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005648>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005634> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0008202>)

