AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0005648> "This term describes the premature separation of paired, intact sister kinetochores. It has a related synonym using \"split kinetochores\" because that phrase is often used in the literature to describe this phenotype. It should not be confused with the FYPO terms that have \"split kinetochore\" in the names, because those names refer to cases where a single kinetochore has broken into parts.")
