# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0006211> (inviable after spore germination, before germ tube formation)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:28572514") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0006211> "A phenotype in which a spore germinates but dies before forming a germ tube or dividing. Such spores exit dormancy and undergo isotropic swelling but the spore wall does not rupture and no germ tube emerges.")
