AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0006715> "This phenotype does not necessarily reflect a chromosome segregation defect. It may instead arise from abnormal nuclear envelope assembly, following normal chromosome segregation.")
