# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0006754> (decreased promoter-enhancer looping during glucose starvation)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:28934464") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mah") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0006754> "A cellular process phenotype in which promoter-enhancer looping occurs to a lower extent than normal when the cell is subject to glucose starvation. Promoter-enhancer looping is mediated by interactions between proteins bound to DNA at promoters and at enhancers, or by a single protein binding at both sites.")
