AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0007391> "FYPO:0007391")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0007391> "Thes phenotype can be observed after a polyploid meiosis, where aneuploid spores no longer form small colonies. This results in an increase of large to small colonies and decreased spore viability.")
