# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0007919> (abnormal RNA alternative polyadenylation)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0007919> "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which alternative polyadenylation of RNA is abnormal. RNA alternative polyadenylation generates RNA molecules with variable 3'-end lengths from a given RNA by differential use of cleavage and polyadenylation signals. Includes differences in the relative usage levels of alternative polyadenylation sites.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0007919> "vw253")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0007919> "2022-01-20T13:49:50Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
