# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0007966> (abolished nuclear displacement from cell division site after abolished mitotic sister chromatid separation)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:33506191") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PomBase:mlr") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0007966> "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which heterothallic haploid cells failing chromosome segregation and  consequently nuclear division fail to displace the nucleus from the septation site. This is normally mediated by actin cables.")
