AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0008176> "This term encompasses both unprocessed RNA transcribed from the centromere inner repeat region and siRNAs derived by dicer-mediated processing of the primary transcripts. Use this term only for levels of RNA transcribed from endogenous centromere inner repeat sequences. For levels of RNA transcribed from an exogenous reporter gene placed in the inner repeat region, consider 'decreased chromatin silencing at centromere outer repeat region' (FYPO:0003412).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0008176> "increased centromeric inner repeat transcript level"@en)
