AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0008403> "normal protein degradation during meiosis"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0008403> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FYPO_0002799>)

